}}

==Enemy==
Dancer Cat has very high health with no clear weaknesses (excluding Ubers), having a fast attack rate, extreme range, and insane damage. Power-stalling with 4 Meat-Shields is definitely required. His stats are magnified by 2x in [[Path of Kung-Fu (Insane)|Insane]], rendering him almost immortal.

==Strategy==
[[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun]] is effective against Dancer Cat, especially if she consecutively knocks him back many times in a row, but their difference in range is only 5, so she won't last long unless she knocks him back a lot.[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)| Bahamut]] can deal heavy damage to Dancer Cat.[[Li'l Nyandam (Special Cat)| Li'l Nyandam]] can last longer due to his range, but he doesn't do much damage. [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]] can also be used. Their ability to slow Dancer Cat helps to keep him away from your attackers. Other long-ranged units may also be of use in his appearances.

